{"id":"wb-4-166","name":"觉生寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大钟寺","text":"大钟寺古钟博物馆，原名觉生寺，因寺内存放永乐大钟，故又俗称大钟寺，位于北京市海淀区北三环西路甲31号，始建于清雍正十一年（1733年），本为皇家汉传佛教寺庙，1985年辟为大钟寺古钟博物馆，为北京市文物局直属单位，展示中、外古代钟铃共400多件。1996年，觉生寺被中华人民共和国国务院列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E9%92%9F%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94887006,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94887006","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/46f1252bdab6c484fb22e5cb.jpg","title":"Big_Bell_Temple_20111003.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Big_Bell_Temple_20111003.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/Big_Bell_Temple_20111003.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"颐园新居","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​大钟寺","width":320,"height":200}}